    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... there isn't another peak. i've spent every ounce of my energy getting here. i feel like i'm just running on empty. everything feels so heavy and there's no motivation left to even start a new climb. it just feels like i've reached the end of the road and there's nothing left to do but wait for it to be over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
